    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "O?Connell Auctioneers are delighted to present 6 Humes Lane, Mallow, a bright and well-presented two-bedroom end-of-terrace property ideally located in the popular West End area, just off Mallow?s main thoroughfare.\n\nEnjoying an exceptionally convenient town-centre location, the property is within easy walking distance of Mallow?s wide range of shops, cafés, schools, restaurants and everyday amenities. Extending to approximately 625 sq. ft. (58.1 sq. m.), the property benefits from a dual-aspect layout which allows excellent natural light throughout the day.\n\nAccommodation\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall with tiled flooring leading to a bright and spacious sitting room with timber flooring and recessed spot lighting. The kitchen is fitted with a range of units and features tiled flooring, recessed lighting and large windows overlooking the rear yard, creating a bright and airy space. Upstairs are two bedrooms, both with timber flooring, together with a fully tiled bathroom incorporating a power shower, WC and WHB.\n\nExternally, the property benefits from an enclosed rear yard with side access and a concrete block shed providing useful additional storage.\n\nKey Features\nExcellent West End location close to Mallow town centre\nWalking distance of shops, schools, cafés and local amenities\nTwo-bedroom end-of-terrace property\nApproximately 625 sq. ft. (58.1 sq. m.)\nBright dual-aspect accommodation\nSpacious sitting room\nEnclosed rear yard with side access\nConcrete block storage shed"
